# Build context = Cargo workspace only. Everything else stays out so source edits elsewhere
# do not bust the dependency (cargo-chef) layer and the context upload stays small.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!rustfmt.toml
!crates/
!docker/

# never ship build output or editor files
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
**/.DS_Store
